{"slug":"Dead-Rails-Beta-Disable-Auto-Aim-for-Mobile-180198","_id":"69d04fae45817c546573ef54","title":"Disable Auto Aim for Mobile","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77d11","gameId":116495829188952,"name":"Dead Rails","imageUrl":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":116495829188952},"features":"This script disable your auto aim completely. No more saying \"auto aim sucks!\".\n\nWell if your aim still sucks even after using this script i guess you got \"Skill Issue\"\n\nDisable this script? Just rejoin the game","tags":["Dead Rails","Aimbot","Auto Aim"],"script":"local Players = game:GetService(\"Players\")\nlocal ReplicatedStorage = game:GetService(\"ReplicatedStorage\")\nlocal LocalPlayer = Players.LocalPlayer\n\nlocal ECS_Components = require(ReplicatedStorage.Shared.Universe.ECS.components)\nlocal ECS_World = require(ReplicatedStorage.Shared.Universe.ECS.world)\n\nlocal function NeutralizeAutoAim()\n    ECS_World:insert_resource(ECS_Components.AimAssistConfigResource, {\n        [\"maxDistance\"] = 0,\n        [\"fovRadius\"] = 0,\n        [\"staminaRefillRate\"] = 0,\n        [\"staminaUseRate\"] = 0,\n        [\"smoothTime\"] = 9999,\n        [\"adsSmoothTime\"] = 9999,\n        [\"adsSmoothTimeMultiplier\"] = 0,\n        [\"smoothTimeDecayRate\"] = 0\n    })\n ECS_World:insert_resource(ECS_Components.AimAssistStateResource, {\n        [\"current\"] = Vector3.new(0, 0, 0),\n        [\"target\"] = Vector3.new(0, 0, 0),\n        [\"velocity\"] = Vector3.new(0, 0, 0),\n        [\"isADS\"] = false,\n        [\"stamina\"] = 0,\n        [\"smoothTime\"] = 9999\n    })\nend\n\nNeutralizeAutoAim()\n\nLocalPlayer.CharacterAdded:Connect(function()\n    task.wait(1)\n    NeutralizeAutoAim()\nend)","owner":{"_id":"69a52d2d9e7d46ac4799c7f2","username":"rendr_sk","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/5a02809cd8e5b9617a9f0fc3